staff   2405 Nov 13 20:41 .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/package.json\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 michelkerkmeester  staff    811 Nov 12 10:24 .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tsconfig.build.json\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 michelkerkmeester  staff    655 Nov 12 10:24 .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tsconfig.json\n=== search 46/47 in feature catalog ===\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/scorer-fusion/command-meaning-matching.md:26:`derive-command-bridges.cjs` writes an `embeddingText` for each command row the TypeScript scorer serves, 47 rows in all. A metadata row leads with its `userIntent.job` sentence and adds its owned phrases. The `description` stands in only when the record states no job. A doctor row uses its router's frontmatter `description` and the route's trigger phrases. Slash command strings are stripped from the text.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && ls -la .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/*.json | head -20 && echo \\\"=== search 46/47 in feature catalog ===\\\" && grep -rn \\\"46 rows\\\\|47 rows\\\\|46\\\\b\\\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/scorer-fusion/*.md | head -20\"}"},"time":{"start":1794780792980,"end":1794780793837}}}}
