ll-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/brief-command-policy-word.md:196:- Playbook ID: CL-009\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/claude-user-prompt-submit.md:2:title: \"CL-001 Claude Code UserPromptSubmit Hook\"\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/claude-user-prompt-submit.md:10:id: CL-001\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/claude-user-prompt-submit.md:19:# CL-001 Claude Code UserPromptSubmit Hook\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/claude-user-prompt-submit.md:118:- Playbook ID: CL-001\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/goal-opencode-plugin-conversation.md:2:title: \"CL-008 -- Goal OpenCode Later-Turn Injection\"\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/goal-opencode-plugin-conversation.md:3:description: \"This scenario validates later-turn active-goal context in the OpenCode goal plugin for CL-008. It focuses on carrying the active goal prompt into a later request.\"\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/goal-opencode-plugin-conversation.md:8:# CL-008 -- Goal OpenCode Later-Turn Injection\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/goal-opencode-plugin-conversation.md:10:This document captures the multi-turn conversation contract, execution flow, source anchors and metadata for CL-008.\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/goal-opencode-plugin-conversation.md:16:This scenario validates later-turn active-goal injection for CL-008. It focuses on whether OpenCode carries an active goal into a separate request in the same session.\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/goal-opencode-plugin-conversation.md:20:CL-007 checks goal state and injection preview within one request. A later task checks whether the active goal prompt is present when the next request reaches the runtime.\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/goal-opencode-plugin-conversation.md:26:Operators run the exact prompt and command sequence for CL-008 and confirm the expected signals without contradictory evidence.\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/goal-opencode-plugin-conversation.md:119:| [goal-opencode-plugin.md](goal-opencode-plugin.md) | Existing CL-007 goal plugin scenario |\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/goal-opencode-plugin-conversation.md:134:- Playbook ID: CL-008\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/goal-opencode-plugin.md:2:title: \"CL-007 Goal OpenCode Plugin\"\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/goal-opencode-plugin.md:10:id: CL-007\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/goal-opencode-plugin.md:19:# CL-007 Goal OpenCode Plugin\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/goal-opencode-plugin.md:173:- Playbook ID: CL-007\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/opencode-plugin-bridge.md:2:title: \"CL-005 OpenCode Plugin\"\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/opencode-plugin-bridge.md:10:id: CL-005\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/opencode-plugin-bridge.md:19:# CL-005 OpenCode Plugin\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/opencode-plugin-bridge.md:107:- Playbook ID: CL-005\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/cli-hooks-and-plugin/skill-advisor-cli-fallback.md:2:title: \"CL-00