{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794781172781,"sessionID":"ses_e1ebd75cbffexH5w3TsJfWYcPu","part":{"partID":"prt_1e14b51aa002idJP28WVnyS3VN","sessionID":"ses_e1ebd75cbffexH5w3TsJfWYcPu","messageID":"msg_1e14b2642001UG6hn3Fkv0QRyn","type":"tool","id":"call_ee3583a389454e89a9ac95c7","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && grep -n \"synthesis\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml | head -40"},"output":"8:action: Run deep-review loop from initialization through synthesis\n323:      After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n325:      phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n540:          applies_when: \"legacy_migration_detected == true and the branch taken resumes the session or goes to synthesis; never on restart or cancel\"\n586:          log: \"Prior session already completed. Either archive the completed review/ tree and start a fresh session, or jump straight to synthesis with the existing artifacts.\"\n587:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n950:          log: \"Duration limit reached after {elapsed_minutes} minutes. Skipping dispatch and entering synthesis with partial findings.\"\n952:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n953:          note: \"The stop row is printed, not appended: the gateway refuses an event it has no ledger stem for. The reason reaches the synthesis report through the bound reason.\"\n1021:          1. if iteration_count >= max_iterations: STOP (maxIterationsReached). This terminal cap is evaluated before every veto, the claim-adjudication veto included; failed legal-stop gates are recorded in stop_decision.blockedBy as synthesis evidence.\n1022:          1a. After 3 consecutive failed iterations (status error or timeout), halt the loop and enter synthesis with stop reason error and partial findings.\n1120:            purpose: \"In confirm mode, ask the operator Retry / Skip / Cancel before synthesis starts.\"\n1127:              C) Cancel: end the run with no synthesis\n1136:            when: \"Run once, immediately before control jumps to phase_synthesis: in if_existing_terminal_path, in the divergent pivot's if_failed and on_error branches, and in every confirm-mode manualStop exit (on_C) into phase_synthesis: both divergent pivot gates, gate_pre_iteration and the post-iteration gate. The auto three-errors stop (reason error) reaches it through if_existing_terminal_path. The duration stop in step_check_max_duration runs it, once, before its jump to phase_synthesis. Never run it when the pivot continues the loop.\"\n1219:                action: \"Adopt a successful read-only review direction or fail closed to the existing synthesis path\"\n1241:                      C) manualStop and proceed to the existing pre-synthesis gate\n1254:                      skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1279:                      A) Fail closed to synthesis\n1281:                      C) manualStop and proceed to the existing pre-synthesis gate\n1298:                      skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1300:                  log: \"Divergent review pivot {pivot_result.pivotId} failed closed ({pivot_result.failureReason}); proceeding to synthesis.\"\n1301:                  skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1304:              log: \"Divergent review pivot integration error; failing closed to the existing synthesis path.\"\n1305:              skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1309:            skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1412:        on_C: { set: { reason: \"manualStop\" }, run_first: record_terminal_gates, proceed_to: phase_synthesis }\n1796:        on_C: { set: { reason: \"manualStop\" }, run_first: record_terminal_gates, proceed_to: phase_synthesis }\n1812:  phase_synthesis:\n1833:        action: \"Hydrate summary metrics before synthesis\"\n1870:          ac_coverage_signal is advisory while the validation rule is INFO/default-off; include it in synthesis traceability, but do not change the exact verdict enum from this signal alone.\n1880:      gate_pre_synthesis:\n1893:          Review the iteration files in `{state_paths.iteration_dir}/` if you want more detail before synthesis.\n1896:          A) Proceed to synthesis (compile review/review-report.md)\n1903:        on_C: { action: \"Cancel synthesis, keep artifacts\", status: \"PARTIAL\" }\n1961:        action: \"If resource_map_present, compute the Resource Map Coverage Gate synthesis inputs; otherwise preserve the skip note\"\n2024:          Preserve machine-owned markers so the reducer-owned registry, dashboard, and strategy anchors can be refreshed on re-run without mutating prior synthesis. (Note: `completed-continue` lineage branch is deferred — see `deep-review/references/protocol/loop-protocol.md §Lifecycle Branches`.)\n2046:          EVENT_DIR=\"$(mktemp -d \"${TMPDIR:-/tmp}/deep-review-synthesis.XXXXXX\")\"\n2047:          CLOSEOUT=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs\"\n2048:          [ -f \"$CLOSEOUT\" ] || CLOSEOUT=\"scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs\"\n2086:        on_fail: \"Log warning. Do not block synthesis. The artifact_dir may be outside a git repo (e.g., temp test fixture) which is a valid case.\"\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"8:action: Run deep-review loop from initialization through synthesis\n323:      After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n325:      phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n540:          applies_when: \"legacy_migration_detected == true and the branch taken resumes the session or goes to synthesis; never on restart or cancel\"\n586:          log: \"Prior session already completed. Either archive the completed review/ tree and start a fresh session, or jump straight to synthesis with the existing artifacts.\"\n587:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n950:          log: \"Duration limit reached after {elapsed_minutes} minutes. Skipping dispatch and entering synthesis with partial findings.\"\n952:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n953:          note: \"The stop row is printed, not appended: the gateway refuses an event it has no ledger stem for. The reason reaches the synthesis report through the bound reason.\"\n1021:          1. if iteration_count >= max_iterations: STOP (maxIterationsReached). This terminal cap is evaluated before every veto, the claim-adjudication veto included; failed legal-stop gates are recorded in stop_decision.blockedBy as synthesis evidence.\n1022:          1a. After 3 consecutive failed iterations (status error or timeout), halt the loop and enter synthesis with stop reason error and partial findings.\n1120:            purpose: \"In confirm mode, ask the operator Retry / Skip / Cancel before synthesis starts.\"\n1127:              C) Cancel: end the run with no synthesis\n1136:            when: \"Run once, immediately before control jumps to phase_synthesis: in if_existing_terminal_path, in the divergent pivot's if_failed and on_error branches, and in every confirm-mode manualStop exit (on_C) into phase_synthesis: both divergent pivot gates, gate_pre_iteration and the post-iteration gate. The auto three-errors stop (reason error) reaches it through if_existing_terminal_path. The duration stop in step_check_max_duration runs it, once, before its jump to phase_synthesis. Never run it when the pivot continues the loop.\"\n1219:                action: \"Adopt a successful read-only review direction or fail closed to the existing synthesis path\"\n1241:                      C) manualStop and proceed to the existing pre-synthesis gate\n1254:                      skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1279:                      A) Fail closed to synthesis\n1281:                      C) manualStop and proceed to the existing pre-synthesis gate\n1298:                      skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1300:                  log: \"Divergent review pivot {pivot_result.pivotId} failed closed ({pivot_result.failureReason}); proceeding to synthesis.\"\n1301:                  skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1304:              log: \"Divergent review pivot integration error; failing closed to the existing synthesis path.\"\n1305:              skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1309:            skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1412:        on_C: { set: { reason: \"manualStop\" }, run_first: record_terminal_gates, proceed_to: phase_synthesis }\n1796:        on_C: { set: { reason: \"manualStop\" }, run_first: record_terminal_gates, proceed_to: phase_synthesis }\n1812:  phase_synthesis:\n1833:        action: \"Hydrate summary metrics before synthesis\"\n1870:          ac_coverage_signal is advisory while the validation rule is INFO/default-off; include it in synthesis traceability, but do not change the exact verdict enum from this signal alone.\n1880:      gate_pre_synthesis:\n1893:          Review the iteration files in `{state_paths.iteration_dir}/` if you want more detail before synthesis.\n1896:          A) Proceed to synthesis (compile review/review-report.md)\n1903:        on_C: { action: \"Cancel synthesis, keep artifacts\", status: \"PARTIAL\" }\n1961:        action: \"If resource_map_present, compute the Resource Map Coverage Gate synthesis inputs; otherwise preserve the skip note\"\n2024:          Preserve machine-owned markers so the reducer-owned registry, dashboard, and strategy anchors can be refreshed on re-run without mutating prior synthesis. (Note: `completed-continue` lineage branch is deferred — see `deep-review/references/protocol/loop-protocol.md §Lifecycle Branches`.)\n2046:          EVENT_DIR=\"$(mktemp -d \"${TMPDIR:-/tmp}/deep-review-synthesis.XXXXXX\")\"\n2047:          CLOSEOUT=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs\"\n2048:          [ -f \"$CLOSEOUT\" ] || CLOSEOUT=\"scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs\"\n2086:        on_fail: \"Log warning. Do not block synthesis. The artifact_dir may be outside a git repo (e.g., temp test fixture) which is a valid case.\"\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && grep -n \\\"synthesis\\\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml | head -40\"}"},"time":{"start":1794781172138,"end":1794781172781}}}}
