{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794781725987,"sessionID":"ses_e1ebd75cbffexH5w3TsJfWYcPu","part":{"partID":"prt_1e153c048001SSpHBkeOnPAtjE","sessionID":"ses_e1ebd75cbffexH5w3TsJfWYcPu","messageID":"msg_1e153a7810011BxgrM1kB5e8j8","type":"tool","id":"call_41dde5b57d0146019bfb3065","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && grep -ni \"holdout\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/changelog/v1.1.0.0.md .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/scorer-fusion/command-meaning-matching.md .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/README.md .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/ROUTER.md .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/README.md; echo \"EXIT=$?\""},"output":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/README.md:135:`advisor_recommend` accepts eight options: `topK` sets how many candidates to return (1 to 10), `includeAttribution` adds per-lane score breakdowns, `includeAbstainReasons` surfaces why lower-ranked candidates were not selected, `confidenceThreshold` overrides the minimum surfaced confidence, `uncertaintyThreshold` overrides the maximum surfaced uncertainty and `includeCompiledRoute` is an optional boolean that defaults to true. Passing `false` skips the compiled-route enrichment so no compiled-route subprocess starts. The prompt hooks send `true`, because a recommendation's `command` comes from its compiled route. `compiledRouteTopOnly` is an optional boolean that defaults to false. Passing `true` looks up the compiled route for the first recommendation only, which saves one subprocess for each further hub. The prompt hooks send it as `true`, so only the top pick can carry a `command`. `surfaceHint` forwards a code surface the caller already knows, such as `SKILLED` (1 to 64 characters), to the compiled-route front door, which ignores an unknown one. `advisor_validate` requires `confirmHeavyRun: true` because it executes the full validation bundle (corpus, holdout, parity, safety, latency).\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/README.md:187:| `advisor_validate` | Run the corpus, holdout, parity, safety and latency bundle (`confirmHeavyRun: true` required) |\nEXIT=0\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/README.md:135:`advisor_recommend` accepts eight options: `topK` sets how many candidates to return (1 to 10), `includeAttribution` adds per-lane score breakdowns, `includeAbstainReasons` surfaces why lower-ranked candidates were not selected, `confidenceThreshold` overrides the minimum surfaced confidence, `uncertaintyThreshold` overrides the maximum surfaced uncertainty and `includeCompiledRoute` is an optional boolean that defaults to true. Passing `false` skips the compiled-route enrichment so no compiled-route subprocess starts. The prompt hooks send `true`, because a recommendation's `command` comes from its compiled route. `compiledRouteTopOnly` is an optional boolean that defaults to false. Passing `true` looks up the compiled route for the first recommendation only, which saves one subprocess for each further hub. The prompt hooks send it as `true`, so only the top pick can carry a `command`. `surfaceHint` forwards a code surface the caller already knows, such as `SKILLED` (1 to 64 characters), to the compiled-route front door, which ignores an unknown one. `advisor_validate` requires `confirmHeavyRun: true` because it executes the full validation bundle (corpus, holdout, parity, safety, latency).\n.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/README.md:187:| `advisor_validate` | Run the corpus, holdout, parity, safety and latency bundle (`confirmHeavyRun: true` required) |\nEXIT=0\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && grep -ni \\\"holdout\\\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/changelog/v1.1.0.0.md .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/scorer-fusion/command-meaning-matching.md .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/README.md .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/ROUTER.md .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/README.md; echo \\\"EXIT=$?\\\"\"}"},"time":{"start":1794781724744,"end":1794781725987}}}}
