{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794781897579,"sessionID":"ses_e1ebd75cbffexH5w3TsJfWYcPu","part":{"partID":"prt_1e155eeca001OcUDJQM06vEFb0","sessionID":"ses_e1ebd75cbffexH5w3TsJfWYcPu","messageID":"msg_1e155d107001CS9YUnikUkBtRn","type":"tool","id":"call_065aa9cde9d4410d8275c3fc","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Review Report - docs-metadata confirm 5b\n\nReview target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (spec-folder review, confirming round 5b).\nLineage: `docs-metadata-confirm-5b`, a fan-out leaf of review pass five.\nIterations: 3 of 3 (iteration cap reached). Stop reason: `maxIterationsReached`.\n\n## Executive Summary\n\n- Overall verdict: **PASS**\n- hasAdvisories: **true**\n- Active findings: **P0 0, P1 0, P2 4**\n- Review scope: the seven `docs-metadata` paths of `review/review-scope-5b.txt` plus the two shared docs that describe the same surfaces (`ROUTER.md`, `README.md`), read against the generated artifacts, code and validators they name.\n- Confirmation result: all eight DM5 fixes (`DM5-P2-001` to `DM5-P2-008`) are verified in place. Two fix-completion gaps remain (one at the skill README, one at the router), and two residual inventory lists remain in the two fixed documents. None is blocking.\n- Operator review focus: Confirming round 5b of code review pass five of command surfacing. Read review/review-brief-5b.txt in the packet first and follow it. Review the files in review-scope-5b.txt whose area equals your lineage label without its -confirm-5b suffix, plus docs that describe them. Each finding is P0, P1 or P2 with file:line and a concrete input. Check that the shell write reader misses no in-place edit, the COMMAND reader reads only a line the model printed as its own, the arena builder refuses a dirty source, a stale build, an escaping or absolute link and answers a failed check with a JSON line, a live turn checks for a remote every turn and has no network push, the kill